Subject: [PATCH 62/79] HACK: winewayland: Add env to enable IME.

Turns out even with all the IME improvements the IME implementations in games are total horse shit, so lets just turn it off for now.

Signed-off-by: Vasiliy Stelmachenok <ventureo@cachyos.org>
---
